{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0e0e5b9cb5b7dacdadac19169b941ee2abeb18589b7e13a286a5faaf4ff43398", "ja": "（映画のPRのため、瑞希は朝のテレビ番組に出演。\nそこで、心霊ドッキリを仕掛けられた……）", "zh": "（为了宣传电影，瑞希出演了早间电视节目。\n结果在那里被安排了灵异整蛊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "b5ab348b10872f9f3c6968549333b1e50e556edf5b656e7a305c9d4e25b3997e", "ja": "{$P$}。お疲れさまでした。\n明日も元気にドッキリ、もとい宣伝を頑張ります。", "zh": "{$P$}。辛苦了。\n明天也会精神满满地努力整蛊——不对，是宣传。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2a9815dd800443705339e0941461f12f195e1687f00e0dfa609d45ac98b96c4a", "ja": "い、いや、明日はドッキリはないよ。それより、さっき\n新しいオファーが来たんだ。聞いたらビックリするぞ！", "zh": "不、不是的，明天没有整蛊哦。比起那个，刚才\n收到了新的通告。你听了肯定会大吃一惊的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "cb9cfa1365951e9cac0c44f82b7a8d7add36f8e16c1972f9ec1f22257856353c", "ja": "そうですか。とてもうれしいです。きっと、\nビックリドッキリな心霊体験なのでしょう。……じっ。", "zh": "这样啊。真是太开心了。一定是一次惊吓连连的灵异体验吧。……盯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7fc3e24674807fefdc29d0fa872363a9f7a6533c650cf3f0e13c684f9d342b04", "ja": "だからドッキリじゃないって……というか、\nもしかしてさっきのドッキリ、怖かったのか……？", "zh": "都说了不是恶作剧……话说，难道刚才那个恶作剧吓到你了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "d1fadb474c4039975e12c5e4c5d4e55570034e4d07ee86cb5cfd8b6bb82dce64", "ja": "はい、とても。\n恐怖で、夜も眠れなくなってしまいそうです。", "zh": "是的，非常害怕。\n恐怕会因为恐惧，连晚上都睡不着了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "d4ef58c985680ed3bf54ab414a0aff9c00abad665decb4dd28ddf3df6cca4947", "ja": "なので、今日のお昼は塩パンにしようと思います。\nおやつは塩大福か、塩キャラメル。……お清め。", "zh": "所以，今天中午我打算吃盐面包。  \n点心就吃盐大福，或者盐焦糖。……净化一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1007_p", "source_sha256": "70079e9a034edcd83d5841107156090e77f0297e8f494d3e8664dcf3d9db05d3", "ja": "そ、そうか。いや、悪かったとは思ってる。\nでも番組だし、事前に教えるわけにも……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。嗯，我也觉得是我不好。可是毕竟是节目，也不能事先告诉你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "ea5b87412c7dec24eed3409428fc373943e82906e6490b69be480f9a8e55ea6a", "ja": "それは理解しています。なのでこうして、\n八つ当たり……いえ、塩対応をしています。", "zh": "我理解这一点。所以才会这样，对你迁怒……不，我是在冷淡应对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6a11916270c77d825d7992f273c5bdd4f1171f3c7c5c032630b632faa67a7c14", "ja": "なるほど、そこにも塩が……。\nよし、だったら次の仕事で気分を一新しよう。", "zh": "原来如此，连那里也有这股冷淡劲儿啊……  \n好，那就用下一份工作转换一下心情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b77e0b71e1758d9be5c3f36342750c4cc26ffdcc0cf0b880736aea43345de53a", "ja": "今度は旅番組のロケだぞ！\n場所はなんと、映画の撮影で行ったあの村だ！", "zh": "这次是去旅行节目外景拍摄哦！\n地点居然是我们之前去拍电影的那个村子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "3cf379456ba44d20a98d3c8bf38d8caac6015cc38ccfcd477ba822daf2f79e83", "ja": "なんと。……また、あの村にですか。", "zh": "真是没想到……又要去那个村子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "6d864448125807e84861dd3acce3da918b7139ff96a7ca139b6e7dc1216253a1", "ja": "撮影中は慌ただしくて、あまりあちこち\n見て回れなかったので……うれしいな。", "zh": "拍摄期间一直忙忙碌碌的，没能好好到处逛逛……真开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1013_p", "source_sha256": "54e02ffed75ba8fead0dae23cee90e77f160cc865615827bc53fec6a0b6214df", "ja": "なんでも、映画のスタッフさんが、その旅番組の\nロケハン担当者さんに紹介してくれたようでな。", "zh": "听说，电影剧组的工作人员把我介绍给了那档旅行节目的外景勘察负责人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "68adcdad9ac6f31e44566be73075f8b419deac9b7380f831dcac1b827479196d", "ja": "素敵なところですからね。村の人たちも、\nいい人ばかりで。撮影中は、とてもお世話に……。", "zh": "因为是个很棒的地方嘛。村里的人也全都是好人。拍摄期间，承蒙他们多方照顾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "9da5f06774b8b45a105419d26c791951d764e13fa646139bc33dd065db480044", "ja": "はっ。……もしやこれも、ドッキリ？\n油断させて廃病院に放置……その手には乗らないぞ。", "zh": "哈。……难道这也是整蛊？先让我放松警惕，再把我丢在废弃医院……我才不上当。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1016_p", "source_sha256": "37df0060e77f48151ddc24835f9696693d26ad96c367f5ae2d86df51ef1ea00f", "ja": "いやいやいや、違うから。安心してくれ！\n正真正銘、ほのぼのした旅番組だ。", "zh": "不不不，不是那样的。你就放心吧！\n货真价实，是一档温馨的旅游节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "a4c0ac465ae984e9f0d002be2bf9ed0a22121fa64d97e7aab7d83d044eb3940a", "ja": "そうですか。では、{$P$}を\n信じます。……ロケ、楽しみだぞ。", "zh": "这样啊。那么，我就相信{$P$}先生。……我很期待外景拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8cc977532dcfa016c8532fc38be354962902877b897e8aff566772e2a9706e6a", "ja": "ああ。当日は、村のいいところを\nたくさん紹介してあげてほしい。", "zh": "啊。当天就请多介绍一些村子的优点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0433_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "21213b0ac5ba25f971b623024a5681b06bdd811e2b7ad5b6ac33d53eb9703ccb", "ja": "もちろんです。\n恩返しをするつもりで、精いっぱい、がんばります。", "zh": "那是当然。\n我会抱着报恩的心情，全力以赴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
